  era: "Section 21 \xB7 Revolt of 1857 \xB7 1857 \u2013 1859"
  title: Causes of the revolt
  text: Annexations, heavy revenue demands, the loss of status of rulers and landlords, fears of religious interference and the grievances of sepoys combined. The immediate spark was the new Enfield rifle cartridge, rumoured to be greased with cow and pig fat.
